# This repository's own files (everything outside the carried tree), kept LF in the repository and in
# the working tree, independent of each contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
#
# The root file exists because the carried AgentsView tree brought its own .gitattributes with it
# (`agentsview/.gitattributes`, carried from upstream): that file governs every path below
# `agentsview/` -- attributes are resolved from the deepest .gitattributes, so its `binary` and
# `linguist-generated` rules win for the paths they name -- and this one covers the other half. Both
# spell the same rule; a checkout on a host with core.autocrlf=true receives LF for both halves.
* text=auto eol=lf
